				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					9.7
				</span></i>
			: also in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμελητέα ἐστί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.24.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
